# Simulator recorders pin this day; the answer is gravy.
wait-for Inkling
expect-missing Shapes, not color
expect-missing Enter guess
tap Rules
expect Black: right spot.
expect Hard mode
expect Guesses can leave out letters found.
clean
shot inkling-help
tap Play
# The board stays in view while typing, and a refused word stays typed.
# Where the keys and the board do not fit together, as at the largest text
# size, Type a guess opens the keys on a screen of their own.
maybe-tap-id enter
type zzzzz
tap Guess
expect Not in the word list
maybe-tap-id enter
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type crane
tap Guess
expect 1 of 6
expect-missing Right spot
clean
shot inkling-knowledge
tap-id game-more
expect New game
expect-missing Hard mode
tap Statistics
expect Played
expect Best streak
tap Play
maybe-tap-id enter
type rival
tap Guess
expect 2 of 6
maybe-tap-id enter
type gravy
tap Guess
expect Solved
clean
shot inkling-solved
tap Statistics
expect 100%
clean
shot inkling-stats
tap Play
tap Play an earlier day
expect August 31, 2026
tap August 31, 2026
expect Archive puzzle
clean
shot inkling-archive
